    <h1 class="lp-h1">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lp-updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how BodyShapeCalculator.net ("we," "us," or "the Site") collects, uses, and protects information when you visit and use our calculators. By using this Site, you agree to the practices described below.</p>

    <h2>1. Information You Enter Into Our Calculators</h2>
    <div class="lp-card">
      <p>Every calculator on this Site — including the Body Type Calculator, Waist-to-Hip Ratio Calculator, and Waist-to-Height Ratio Calculator — runs entirely in your web browser. The measurements you enter (bust, waist, hips, chest, height, weight, or any other figure) are processed locally on your device using JavaScript and are <strong>never transmitted to, or stored on, our servers</strong>. We have no way of seeing or accessing the numbers you enter.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect Automatically</h2>
    <p>Like most websites, we and our third-party partners may automatically collect certain technical information when you visit, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>IP address and approximate geographic location</li>
      <li>Browser type, device type, and operating system</li>
      <li>Pages visited, time spent on the Site, and referring website</li>
      <li>General usage patterns, collected via analytics tools</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This information is used in aggregate to understand how visitors use the Site and to improve our content and tools. It is not used to identify you personally.</p>

    <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device. We use cookies, and allow trusted third parties to use cookies, for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Essential cookies</strong> — to remember your unit preference (inches/centimeters) and similar interface settings within a session</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — to understand aggregate traffic and usage patterns</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising cookies</strong> — used by third-party ad networks (see Section 4) to serve relevant ads</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can disable cookies through your browser settings at any time. Doing so may affect some functionality of the Site.</p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p>This Site may display advertisements served by Google AdSense and other third-party advertising networks. These third parties may use cookies, web beacons, or similar technologies to collect information about your visits to this and other websites in order to provide advertisements about goods and services that may interest you.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Google uses the DoubleClick DART cookie to serve ads based on your visits to this Site and other sites on the internet.</li>
      <li>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Ad Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, may show our ads on other sites you visit across the internet.</li>
      <li>For more on how Google uses data when you use our Site, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Partner Sites policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not control the cookies placed by third-party advertisers and are not responsible for their individual privacy practices. We encourage you to review their respective privacy policies directly.</p>

    <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>This Site is not directed at children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will take steps to remove it.</p>

    <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
    <p>Since measurements entered into our calculators never leave your browser, there is no measurement data for us to secure or lose. For the limited technical and usage data described in Section 2, we take reasonable measures to protect it, though no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>

    <h2>7. International Users</h2>
    <p>This Site is accessible worldwide. If you are visiting from the European Economic Area (EEA), United Kingdom, or California, you may have additional rights regarding your personal data under GDPR or CCPA, including the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal data we may hold. Contact us using the details below to exercise these rights.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for legal, operational, or regulatory reasons. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of the Site after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please reach out via our <a href="/contact-us/">Contact page</a> or email us directly at <strong>info@bodyshapecalculator.net</strong>.</p>
